{"overview":"آدریان مونک زمانی یک ستاره در حال ظهور در اداره پلیس سانفرانسیسکو بود، افسانه‌ بجهت استفاده از شیوه‌های غیر متعارف برای حل گیج کننده‌ترین پرونده‌های این اداره. اما پس از قتل غم‌انگیز (و هنوز حل نشده) همسرش ترودی، او دچار یک مورد شدید اختلال وسواس فکری-جبری می‌شود. مونک اکنون به‌عنوان یک مشاور خصوصی کار می‌کند و به بررسی پرونده‌ها به غیر متعارف‌ترین روش‌ها ادامه می‌دهد.","tagline":"وسواسی. جبری. کاراگاه.","overview_en":"Adrian Monk was once a rising star with the San Francisco Police Department, legendary for using unconventional means to solve the department's most baffling cases. But after the tragic (and still unsolved) murder of his wife Trudy, he developed an extreme case of obsessive-compulsive disorder. Now working as a private consultant, Monk continues to investigate cases in the most unconventional ways.","tagline_en":"Obsessive. Compulsive. Detective.","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":30,"y":null,"poster":"/uvBspMtQqeHeZEemrebPdGVKJuG.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2002,"poster":"/ptrGCrl06F02vGTCP4pTjTOJRoI.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":16,"y":2003,"poster":"/4rNLiOF7unzKoQVwtzgV6UlHmMo.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":16,"y":2004,"poster":"/94uocWMVwonT9ePc11to9v4Mc9v.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":16,"y":2005,"poster":"/nInRIpdJGaSd3FCBjOp9kFpGzxF.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":16,"y":2006,"poster":"/zp71ttEAeiOnSbvPMmL90yeEK7L.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":16,"y":2007,"poster":"/ndGfDgq9aDkod5pPD99RthQMc4t.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":16,"y":2008,"poster":"/nnhCt4K3zRxoIqo2jld6UO7GD9Y.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":16,"y":2009,"poster":"/xyiVA4XClkaeo4KhWz8u1e0DBr3.jpg"}],"episodes":124,"crew":["اندی برکمن"],"crew_en":["Andy Breckman"],"countries":["US","CA"],"cast":[{"name":"تونی شالهوب","role":"Adrian Monk","photo":"/1zfBSuAmOr1xXjNg4WzFWPm5B0Z.jpg","en":"Tony Shalhoub"},{"name":"Ted Levine","role":"Leland Stottlemeyer","photo":"/451KSkowLW6M2Au0wBKZZcidgGm.jpg"},{"name":"Ja